<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-045-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.184997" lon="-120.840326"><name>SC26-045-B</name><cmt>SC26-045</cmt><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 5.5 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 60/100; not catch probability. Center 81 ft; nearby 78–95 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. About 959 m from screened closed/access-restricted area; plan entire drift clear. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-027</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 225-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.1868513502655" lon="-120.84066155921002"/><trkpt lat="35.18700417123188" lon="-120.84065751459471"/><trkpt lat="35.187024416517374" lon="-120.84027233452234"/><trkpt lat="35.18697686383312" lon="-120.83979157409132"/><trkpt lat="35.186764247049254" lon="-120.83911452161664"/><trkpt lat="35.186249107255115" lon="-120.83838296009947"/><trkpt lat="35.18554334528642" lon="-120.83794722158852"/><trkpt lat="35.184754410119695" lon="-120.83787363693634"/><trkpt lat="35.184002410248354" lon="-120.83817339859945"/><trkpt lat="35.18340182809784" lon="-120.8388008626281"/><trkpt lat="35.18310362210896" lon="-120.83944306823633"/><trkpt lat="35.18322747210031" lon="-120.83965940098328"/><trkpt lat="35.18358790170513" lon="-120.83964985852722"/><trkpt lat="35.18358986023683" lon="-120.83975961316543"/><trkpt lat="35.18377007504334" lon="